{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号浅灰色标题，第一眼落在“未必找得回那份亲近”，随后看到“先把眼下日子过稳些”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"似乎失去了原有的亲近感，眼下选择先把自己的生活稳定下来。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定；标题带有无奈、遗憾的意味，但没有直接呈现具体情绪。\",\n  \"missed\": \"害怕仍然存在，但人已经开始继续向前走；这种恐惧与行动并存的关系藏在下方正文后半段。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块正文较长，包含音乐变化、前进过程和人物心理好几层意思\",\n    \"核心情绪线索落在正文末尾，需要继续扫读才能发现\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "935e581e-9e6c-4256-8b04-8b6ab8c7b7d6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023630764267Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:36:54.711104+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "49da18f4a3a91c6fea0b5209eaf0aad91091108dbcb556077ebc0f3106677692", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370